  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile settings with avgpool aggregation and concat fusion (config_018) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.6186). This experiment tests whether replacing the ResNet50 image encoder with a more advanced ViT-L model (imagenet_vit_l) in the same multiprofile setup isolates the impact of the image encoder choice. This clarifies whether the image modality's representation significantly affects performance, while keeping other factors constant. It is a focused comparison that reduces uncertainty about a critical design choice (image encoder) without overcomplicating the model."
}

